		{
			"id":"67c557077fa3d502",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- How do I take water from one place to the Library?\n\t- At the Greenhouse there is an item that can be used to water other places - [[Watering Can.canvas|Watering Can]]\n\t- Do I need to refill it with water from places with still water?\n- If the still water can tint blank books, can it tint the paper in the Master Bedroom?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1246,
			"y":-260,
			"width":440,
			"height":320
		},
		{
			"id":"436105115f8df0d9",
